    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kwiyoolecha kū bahemba mpungatī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma hangī ū Yesu akīīta wiyoolecha ū kū bahemba bakwe baalī kū nyanza ya Tiberia. Ū mu kwiyoolecha kwakwe ī mihayo yalī gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Simoni Petelo walī hamò na Tomaso, ūyo witanagwa “Wībasa”, na Natanaeli ū muna Kana ya Galilaya; hamò na ba ng'wana Zebedayo, na bahemba bangī babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Simoni Petelo ūbawīla a biye gīkī, “Bing'we bagosha, naja kūtega ndīlo ū nene.” Nabo būng'wīla, “Nise tūlīja hamò nang'ho!” Ng'hana būja būūkingīla mu lyato. Alīyo ū būjikū wenūbo batagwashije shose shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wela ī dilū, bahayimanīla ū Yesu wīmīīla a ha ng'walo; gwike a boi a bahemba batang'witegelegije gīkī hū walī ng'wene ū Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ubawila gīkī, “Bing'we basūmba, mulī na shilīwa shose shose?” Nabo būnshokeja, “Yaya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Tegagi ū ntego a ha lwandī lwa būlyo bo lyato aho, mukūgwasha!” Na ng'hana aho bagūtega, būlemeelwa nū kūgūzubūla kūlwa wingī bo ndīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ng'hemba ūyo Yesu walī antogilwe ūng'wīla ū Petelo gīkī, “Bebe hū ng'wene ū Seeba!” Ū Simoni Petelo aho wigwa gīkī ū ng'wenūyo walī Seeba, witunga ng'wenda; nguno walī dūūhū, hūna wiponeja mu nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bahemba a bangī būshikīīla bo lyato balīgūduta ū ntego go ndīlo, nguno baalī batī kūle nū ng'walo. Boolī bū kūle bo magūlū gītī igana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashika a ha ng'walo būsanga moto gwa makala gobachiwagwa, a higūlya yago īlīho ndīlo na ngatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūbawīla gīkī, “Enhagi aha ndīlo ījo ng'wagwasha haha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Simoni Petelo ūja ūūkagūduta ū ntego ūgwenha ha ng'walo; gwalī gokala pa, ndīlo nhaale nhaale igana na makūmi atanò n'idatū. Alīyo nūūlū īkī gwalī gokola gīko, nahene gūtatandūkile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūbawīla gīkī, “Nzūgi aha mulye.” Alīyo nūūlū ūmò wa bahemba atagimile kūmūja, Ūlī nani?” Nguno bakamana gīkī hū ng'wene ū Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu wiza ūgūsola ū ngatī ūbinha; nī ndīlo wīta gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lwenūlo lūbiza lūkangala lo kadatū ū Yesu kwiyoolecha ū kū bahemba bakwe kūfuma a h'ikanza lya kūjūūka kokwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho bamala ū kūlya, ū Yesu ūmūja ū Simoni Petelo gīkī, “Simoni ng'wana Yohana, ū bebe ūnitogilwe kūbatinda a benaba?” Ūng'wīla, “Alichene Seeba; ū bebe ūmanile gīkī nakūtogilwe.” Ūng'wīla, “Balishage a baana ba ng'holo bane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmūja hangī lo kabīlī, “Simoni ng'wana Yohana, ūnitogilwe?” Nang'hwe ūng'wīla, “Alichene Seeba; ūmanile nakūtogilwe.” Ūng'wīla “Jidīīmage ī ng'holo jane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmūja hangī lo kadatū, “Simoni ng'wana Yohana, ūnitogilwe?” Nose ū Petelo ūpīnīhala, nguno ū Yesu akamūja lūkangala lo kadatū gīkī, Ūnitogilwe?” Na ūng'wīla, Ū bebe Seeba ūmanile pyī ī yose, ūmanile gete ī gīkī nakūtogilwe.” Hūna ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Jilishage ī ng'holo jane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nalīkūwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, aho ūtaalī ūlī nsūmba ūkūmanitunga bebe ng'wenekīlī waja ūko ūtogelilwe. Alīyo ūlū ūlanamhaale, ūkūgagoloola a makono gako, na munhū ūngī akūtunge akūtwale ūko ūtatogilwe kūja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mukūgūhaya ū gwenūyo, akoolecha ūmo akūchīla ū Petelo, kūlwa kūnkūja Mulungu. Aho wamala kūhaya gīko ūng'wīla; “Nilondeelage.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Petelo aho wikībūka ūmona ū ng'hemba ūyo Yesu walī antogilwe, ūyo h'ikanza lya shilīwa walī wigasha wihela nang'hwe haho hihi; ūmūja na gīkī, “Seeba nani ūyo akūkūnodeela?” Ū ng'wenūyo nang'hwe wakūūbījaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Petelo aho wamona ū ng'hemba ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla ū Yesu gīkī, “Seeba al'ūyū nang'hwe hangī ginehe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūng'wīla “Ī gīsī gūlīho mhayo kī ū kūlī bebe, ūlū nūbiza natogilwe ū ng'wenūyū ashinge ho kūshisha nashoke? Ū bebe ng'wene nilondeelage dūhū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mu badūgū gūkumūka gwa gīkī ū ng'hemba ng'wenūyo atūcha! Alīyo ū Yesu atahayile gīkī atūcha. Akahaya dūhū gīkī, “Ī gīsī gūlīho mhayo kī ū kūlī bebe, ūlū nūbiza natogilwe ū ng'wenūyū ashinge ho kūshisha nashoke?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'hemba ū ng'wandīki wayo ī mihayo yenīyī hū ng'wene ū mbona wayo, na hangī tūmanile gīkī ū būkaanīji bokwe būlī bo ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yīngī mingī īlīho īyo wabeeja ū Yesu; ūlū ni kwandīkwa pyī ī yose būlī gwene gūmò gūmò, naliganika nūūlū ī sī yenekīlī ni ītadūgije ū kūshibūūcha ī shandīkwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
